 our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":113,"line":"Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":113,"line":"Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":113,"line":"Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":119,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":119,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Thornfield this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":123,"line":"Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":123,"line":"Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":123,"line":"Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 1,688 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."}]},"refusalSnapshots":[{"day":94,"callYield":2,"omenStage":2,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":45,"opinion":11,"arrears":9750,"quota":2,"facesFree":0,"wouldYield":0,"wouldRefuse":true},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":67,"opinion":25,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"facesFree":9,"