elationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":37,"line":"🗣️ Word with the traders: Ashford sent Stonebridge grain when their stores ran thin — no tribute, no ceremony, just food on the road. That's a thing villages DO now."},{"day":38,"line":"🏃 Tariq of Stonebridge walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Stonebridge has grain to spare — 2,027 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,642 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Emberhold's tribute comes up thin — 1,642 of 4,000 kcal. They sent everything the wagons could carry, and it wasn't enough. The shortfall rides as arrears (+2,358 kcal). (Trust -1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":43,"line":"🏃 Tariq of Stonebridge walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Stonebridge has grain to spare — 2,680 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":43,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,960 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":53,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"One fire was a village. Two fires is a NETWORK. Coordination layer: online — tribute, demands, the long climb, all tracked now. Try not to starve twice as fast.\""},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Emberhold's tribute comes up thin — 608 of 4,000 kcal. They sent everything the wagons could carry, and it wasn't enough. The shortfall rides as arrears (+3,392 kcal). (Trust -1.)"},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":59,"line":"🏃 Tariq of Stonebridge walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Stonebridge has grain to spare — 1,551 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":60,"line":"Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":60,"line":"Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":60,"line":"Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 3,000 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":60,"line":"Took Tribute grain from Stonebridge (dried)."},{"day":60,"line":"You eat Tribute grain from Stonebridge (dried) (400 kcal)."},{"day":60,"line":"Took Tribute grain from Stonebridge (dried)."},{"day":60,"line":"You eat Tribute grain from Stonebridge (dried) (400 kcal)."},{"day":