 — 2,617 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":76,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"Four fires. One head. GOVERNANCE LAYER: online — polity tribute routing, the court calendar, famine reserves. You built a realm. Try not to lose it the way you found it.\""},{"day":76,"line":"Emberhold watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":76,"line":"Stonebridge watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":76,"line":"Thornfield watches to see if Haven holds without its dead — and presses the tribute down to 2,250 kcal/week while the chair is empty. They'll test the link. Count on it."},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 2,813 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":80,"line":"🏃 Hana of Emberhold walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Emberhold has grain to spare — 2,094 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +2,250 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Thornfield arrives — 2,250 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."}],"village_1":[{"day":75,"line":"🏃 Hana of Emberhold walks into Haven unannounced, pack-mules behind. \"Heard your bins are echoing. Emberhold has grain to spare — 2,617 kcal, no tribute, no ceremony. Say the word.\""},{"day":76,"line":"◈ SYSTEM: \"Four fires. One head. GOVERNANCE LAYER: online — polity tribu